{"3152340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kyndykan", "steam_appid": 3152340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kyndykan</i> is a story-driven adventure about a girl and her reindeer. Explore the living North, fight the corruption, and bring life back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kyndykan, from the Even people. Her brother has been taken, and the land is dying. Together with the white reindeer Ghirke, she sets out on a journey to save her brother and heal the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your companion is your strength.</strong> Ghirke grows alongside you, unlocking new abilities. Feed him, strengthen your bond — and he will become a mighty ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey across the North.</strong> Explore tundra and mountains on reindeer-back, sail lakes by boat. The northern lights and changing seasons bring the world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight as one.</strong> Kyndykan wields her ancestral staff, while Ghirke charges foes and unleashes magic. Each enemy demands a different approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleanse the land.</strong> Solve puzzles, find artifacts, lift the curse — and watch the world heal before your eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and culture.</strong> Gather resources, create items, and connect with the culture of the Northern peoples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kyndykan</i> is a story of growing up, friendship, and healing. A journey you will remember.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kyndykan</i> is a story-driven adventure about a girl and her reindeer. Explore the living North, fight the corruption, and bring life back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kyndykan, from the Even people. Her brother has been taken, and the land is dying. Together with the white reindeer Ghirke, she sets out on a journey to save her brother and heal the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your companion is your strength.</strong> Ghirke grows alongside you, unlocking new abilities. Feed him, strengthen your bond — and he will become a mighty ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey across the North.</strong> Explore tundra and mountains on reindeer-back, sail lakes by boat. The northern lights and changing seasons bring the world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight as one.</strong> Kyndykan wields her ancestral staff, while Ghirke charges foes and unleashes magic. Each enemy demands a different approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleanse the land.</strong> Solve puzzles, find artifacts, lift the curse — and watch the world heal before your eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and culture.</strong> Gather resources, create items, and connect with the culture of the Northern peoples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Kyndykan</i> is a story of growing up, friendship, and healing. A journey you will remember.</p>", "short_description": "«Kyndykan» is a story-driven action adventure about a girl and her magical reindeer, inspired by the living mythology of the indigenous peoples of the North. Explore, fight, care for your companion, and uncover a tale of healing and friendship.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "ht